er-1st-half-asian-handicap-3-0\":\"Give the Home Team A Headstart Of 3 Goals For the Score At the End Of 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time).\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-handicap-4-0\":\"Give the Home Team A Headstart Of 4 Goals For the Score At the End Of 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time).\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-handicap-5-0\":\"Give the Home Team A Headstart Of 5 Goals For the Score At the End Of 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time).\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-handicap-alternative\":\"Give A Team A Disadvantage Or Headstart On Goals For the Score At the End Of the 1st Half Of Regulation Time & Add Another Alternative Like Corners Or Cards. the Outcome Can'T Be A Draw.\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-handicap-corners\":\"Give A Team A Disadvantage Or Headstart On Corners For the 1st Half Of Regulation Time. the Outcome Can'T Be A Draw.\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-total-corners\":\"Predict the Total Number Of Corners At the End Of 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time).\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-total-goals\":\"Predict the Total Number Of Goals At the End Of 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time).\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-asian-total-goals-alternative\":\"Predict the Total Number Of Goals At the End Of 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time) & Other Alternatives Like Corners Or Cards\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-away-no-bet\":\"Predict If the Way Team Will Win Or Draw the Match In the 1st Half. If the Home Team Wins, the Match Will Be Resulted In A Loss. It It'S A Draw, Your Wager Amount Will  Be Refunded\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-away-team-total-corners\":\"Predict If the Amount Of Corners the Away Team Is Awarded In the 1st Half Of Regulation Time (Excl. Extra Time) Is Over Or Under A Certain Amount.\",\"tooltips.soccer-1st-half-away-team-total-corners-oddeven\":\"Predict If the Amount Of Corners the Away Team Is Awarded In the 1st Half Of Regulation Time 